Z||000006||Ken Wittlief||05-25-2001||02:16 PM||||what is with the clear tail light lenses?!<P>  apparently someone FORGOT that tail lights are also reflectors! - if you park your car on the side of the road then the headlites from passing cars reflect RED so they can tell there is a car parked there!<P>  or if you are sitting in the middle of the road with dead electrical system, 18 wheelers coming up on you at 75mph see your tailites refecting RED LIGHT!<P>  I guess thats not important any more?!||||reg||1
