Z||000011||Jaei Sun||05-25-2001||08:14 PM||||I was at the import drag day at Rockfalls in Wisconsin a few weeks ago and snapped some pix of the imports done tastefully there.  This one was one of my favorites... screw clear taillights... I think these "Alteeza" taillights would look really good on a fiero.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/alteezas.jpg">  <P>I already made my own for my daily driver Beretta.  And for those concerned about the reflective issue... see the silver strip that runs horizontal??  That's 3m reflective tape so it lights up pretty good when (head)light hits it!<P> <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/retta_alt.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/trans_fiero_sig2.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Jaei Sun (edited 05-25-2001).]||||reg||4
